{"id":"desgracia","lemma":"desgracia","pos":"noun","rank":1487,"glosses":["disgrace","misfortune, bad luck","accident, disaster"],"ipa":"/desˈɡɾaθja/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"desgracias"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/95/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-desgracia.wav","examples":[{"text":"¡Qué desgracia!","en":"What rotten luck!","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/443425","words":[{"g":"what"},null]},{"text":"Por desgracia, murió mucha gente.","en":"Sadly, many people died.","words":[{"g":"for / by"},null,{"g":"to die","l":"morir"},{"g":"much","l":"mucho"},{"g":"people"}]},{"text":"Por desgracia no nos queda otra opción.","en":"I'm afraid we have no choice.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/831474","words":[{"g":"for / by"},null,{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"us"},{"g":"curfew"},{"g":"someone else","l":"otro"},{"g":"option"}]},{"text":"Aquel que no conoce del amor no conoce de desgracias.","en":"One who knows no love knows no unhappiness.","words":[{"g":"that (over there"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to know","l":"conocer"},{"g":"of the"},{"g":"love"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to know","l":"conocer"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"Por desgracia, hoy está lloviendo.","en":"Unfortunately, it's raining today.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/687814","words":[{"g":"for / by"},null,{"g":"today, tonight"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"to rain","l":"llover"}]}]}